    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a versatile army and adapt it to <strong>your playstyle!</strong>\u00a0In this <strong>physics-based</strong> real-time strategy game no one is safe from the war over the valuable resource <i>Zenith</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/4434f27c1da92776387480046b223e48.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/0077c380c635b5d58c467a2ad3b5e0f7.poster.avif?t=1732013417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/0077c380c635b5d58c467a2ad3b5e0f7.webm?t=1732013417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/0077c380c635b5d58c467a2ad3b5e0f7.mp4?t=1732013417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/422d5fb6db4c26dbe7734bcfab97f273.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/326eb3310fc7d8a0ff4d0c1ac890bc7d.avif?t=1732013417\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/ad89fec874f09b1773ae9f4a246f5566.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Customize your army</strong> \u2014 Select from a variety of units and components for your army</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Build your base and gather resources</strong> \u2014 Build key structures to put your strategic plan into action and harvest the fields of Zenith</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Upgrade your units</strong> \u2014 Adapt to your enemy's forces by researching powerful upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Take advantage of your arsenal</strong> \u2014 Hovercraft, mechs, air-based units and infantry (including cyborgs and robots) all take important roles in your strategic plan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Embrace real-world physics</strong> \u2014 Vehicles are pushed back by nearby explosions and can collide with each under extreme conditions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/8c5b32a1113c419d9635a436c9f63728.avif?t=1732013417\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/ad89fec874f09b1773ae9f4a246f5566.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Singleplayer Campaign</strong> \u2014 Follow a gripping story with unexpected twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Multiplayer Matchmaking</strong> \u2014 Find others to play with in quick match or the server browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Skirmish</strong> \u2014 Train against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Level Editor</strong> \u2014 Easily create and share your own levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/120b5b9b18bd3de1c5e54b3754ff940a.avif?t=1732013417\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/ad89fec874f09b1773ae9f4a246f5566.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div>It's the year 2049. The most powerful catalyst for human conflict is blanketing the earth's surface: Zenith. After the fall of the old world government Naos, two opposing factions known as the Phoenix and the Eclipse are struggling for world dominion in a new ice age. The Eclipse fight to establish a currupted order, not unlike the tyranny the fallen Naos had put in place before, while Phoenix is desperately keeping them at bay. Defeat the Eclipse, no matter what the cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/4434f27c1da92776387480046b223e48.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/1dda6e1e81219430f0ac510ef5fb2679.poster.avif?t=1732013417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/1dda6e1e81219430f0ac510ef5fb2679.webm?t=1732013417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/1dda6e1e81219430f0ac510ef5fb2679.mp4?t=1732013417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126360/extras/422d5fb6db4c26dbe7734bcfab97f273.webp?t=1732013417\" /></div>Taking on the role of a young commander you lead your forces to fight the mysterious enemy. You are tasked to halt the advancing legions in their tracks to retake what was once ours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you unveil the hidden face of this war?</p>",
